&lt;h2 id="简介"&gt;简介&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 id="章节列表"&gt;章节列表&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/1" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第一章 - 来到地狱（开学第一天就被扇奶子，上课被抠逼到高潮）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/2" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二章 - 疯狂被虐（上课被疯狂操逼，被全班同学虐到昏死）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/3" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三章 - 被玩烂了（教室阴蒂被校医注射超敏药物 在教室再次被虐到疯狂高潮）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/4" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第四章 - 阴蒂断裂（骚逼在上课时被塞按摩棒，被老师用高跟鞋碾断阴蒂）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/5" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第五章 - 贱货的公开羞辱（被强迫给校长舔脚，脱光衣服在全校同学面前屈辱爬行）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/6" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第六章 - 宿舍之夜（被舍友吊起来各种凌辱，踩逼，玩弄阴蒂，言语羞辱）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/7" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第七章 - 诅咒的具象化（阴蒂变异成超敏感的阴茎，在课堂上被同桌疯狂玩弄到究极高潮）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/8" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第八章 - 不停地高潮（在全班注视下屈辱爬行疯狂高潮，被女生们吊起来轮流给阴蒂阴茎口交到崩溃）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/9" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第九章 - 集体的狂欢（上自习课憋尿到崩溃求饶，强制自己给自己的阴蒂阴茎口交到疯狂高潮）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/10" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十章 - 榨取精华（被变态美女老师继续玩弄已经濒临坏死的阴蒂阴茎，强行刺激尿道深处的嫩肉再次不停地达到突破极限的绝顶高潮）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/11" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十一章 - 坏死（阴蒂阴茎被女班长强行榨取高潮，被美女化学老师注射超敏药物刺激到彻底坏死）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/12" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十二章 - 被训成母狗（被体育女生进行轮流口交一整天的耐力训练，阴蒂阴茎被一脚踢烂，当着全校同学的面尿失禁高潮）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/13" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十三章 - 边缘控制（阴蒂阴茎被残忍地一刀切断，美女老师一直边缘控制不让高潮，下贱的求饶，最后高潮绝顶一直喷射到昏死）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/14" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十四章 - 谢萌琪的七次机会（七次让苏芷莹摆脱凌辱地狱的挑战，阴蒂阴茎被车碾压成肉饼但是必须得忍住不呻吟不叫）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/fcbfcada8ebd48998e395a3a564836f3/reader/15" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十五章 - 黎田雨的挑战（用弹弓打阴蒂阴茎，龟头被打凹陷，阴蒂阴茎直接被打爆，疯狂喷射到昏死）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>反差母狗的彻底摧毁</title><link>https://v2acg.github.io/novels/co4so48o0ck8wwxu/</link><pubDate>Mon, 05 Jan 2026 04:46:54 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://v2acg.github.io/novels/co4so48o0ck8wwxu/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="本页为收录内容-点击下方按钮跳转查看内容详情"&gt;本页为收录内容 点击下方按钮跳转查看内容详情&lt;/h2&gt;
